{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Oasis 是一款以自然音效配合雙耳節拍的聲音應用，讓你可為睡眠、專注、冥想或單純放鬆建立個人化音景。無論是考試前溫習、上台前平復緊張情緒，還是結束漫長一天後沉澱心情，都能藉由聲音找回理想狀態。軟件原價 US $99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自然音效與雙耳節拍自由疊加</h2>\n<p>Oasis 收錄超過 30 段高質自然錄音與環境音效，並提供橫跨平靜、冥想、專注與活力四大方向的 16 組預設。你可把雨聲、鳥鳴、火焰等素材與雙耳節拍疊加，再以空間 3D 音效把聲音置於四周，讓它們在空間中緩緩流動。Memory Preset 會自動記錄每次聆聽，另支援背景播放與 AirPlay，無需註冊帳戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1260x2736bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1260x2736bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1260x2736bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1260x2736bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1260x2736bb-9-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1260x2736bb-10-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Oasis: Binaural Soundscapes</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T15:59:24.063856+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}